<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">2 Korinth</book>
  <para style="h">2 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Korinth</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korinth</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Korinth</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul Pasian deilam a Jesu Khrist sawltah leh i unaupa uh Timothi in Korinth khuo a um Pasian hattuomte leh Akaia gam pumpi a misiengthoute zousie kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian ipa u’leh Mangpa Jesu Khrist kunga kipat hepina leh hamuonna na kung uah um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Mangpa Jesu Khrist Pasian leh Pa phat in um hen. Ama khotuona Pa leh lungmuonna Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian in koute ahing hamuonna mama khu a kouten zong hasatna thuoh poumate ka hamuon theina dingun, Aman ka hasatna zousie uah ahing hamuon zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khrist thuohgimnate koute sunga akiningchin bangin, Khrist zieha ka kihenepna u’zong akiningching hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kouten gimgentheina ka thuoh u’leh, noute kihenepna ding leh hundamna ding ahia, tua kihenepnain kouten ka thuoh bang uh thuohzouna ahing siem a, koute hamuon a ka um u’leh noute kihenepna leh hundamna ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Noute gimgentheina thuohte na hi bangun, henepna tangmite zong na hi uh chi theiin ka hing kineppina uh adet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asia gam a gimgentheina ka thuoh uh chi theilou unaute na hi uh ka dei sih uhi. Kouten ka thuoh zou val uh, tunggihna te guollou ka thuoh ua, hinna nangawn mansuo ka zau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahi, kouma leh kouma kingaisutna ah, shina thukhenna thuohta bangin ka kithei uhi, tua pen kouma kimuonglou a mishite kaithoupa Pasian ka muon zohna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman hichikhopa shina zauhuoi thupi lah a kipat ahing hundohta a, ahing hundoh lellel a, ahing hundoh nalai ding hi chi’n Ama ka muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi tampite akipata silpieh ka mu zieh ua, mi tampiten koute dinga kipahthu agen theina dingun, nouten zong koute dinga thu na hing ngetpieh chietna un, na hing panpi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koute’n ka kisuonpi uh tami ahi; ka sie leh pha theina uh hing theipi, sienthouna leh Pasian dihna neiin tahsa pilna a hilouin, Pasian hepina hizawin leitungah, ka gamta ua, tualeh adiehin noulam ah ka gamta hoizaw sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen na sim thei u’leh na theisiem dingte uh chilou adang bangma ka giel sih uhi, atawp donga na theikim dinguh ka gingta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu ni hing tun chienga noute ka kisahtheipite na hi ding bang ua, koute zong na kisahtheipite uh ka hi ding uh, chi theina chieng na hing neita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tambang kimuonna nei in, noute kung hing phah masah ka sawm hi. Nouten phattuomna nivei na tan theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Masidonia gam a ka haw chiengin noute ka hing ve dinga, Masidonia gam a pat kang kilekia chiengin na kung ua hing peikia vangin tualeh Judia gam lam a ka peina dingah hing ha ulachin ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin tami ka tup laiin bailamtaha ka tup ahiei mah? Ahisihleh ka siltupte tahsa dan a ahileh hi, ahilouleh hilou, chi kawma tum ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian amuonhuoi bangin, noute lam a ka thugen uh, ahi, chileh hilou chi ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen na lah ua Koute: Kei, Silvanus leh Timothi in athu kagen uh, Pasian Tapa Jesu Khrist khu, ahi chi leh hilou chi ahi sih a, Ama ah ahi, chi ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thuchiem zousie khu Ama ah ahi chi ahia, tualeh koute zieh a Pasian thupina dingin Ama ah, Amen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh Koute Khrist a nou toh hing sudetpa leh koute sathau hing nupa khu Pasian ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman eite ahing chiemte a, tualeh ilungtang sung uah khamna hagau ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuathamlouin ka hinna tunga theipipa dingin Pasian ka han ahi, noute kang khawi nopna a Korinth a hing haw nawnlou ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na ginna tung ua thunei ut ka hisih ua, na lungnopna ding ua noute toh semkhawm ka hi zaw uhi, azieh pen ginna a ding det na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hinanleh lunggim sasa a na kung ua hing hawkia nawnlou dingin ka lungsim ah thutanna ka bawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen ken noute hing lunggimsah taleng, ka suh lunggimte ma chilou kei hing kipahsah ding koi dang a um diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na kung uah tam thu ma ahi ka hing gel, tuachilouin ka hing pei chiengin, ka kipahna ding noute lah ah lunggimna ka mu zaw kha ding hi; ka kipahna khu noute zousie kipahna hi ding in, kimuonna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen lunggimna leh gimgentheina thuoh pumin hitui tampi toh tam thu ka hing giel hi, suh lunggim a na umlouna dingun, na tung uah itna kiningching ka nei hi chi na thei zohna ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh mi koi ahiei in lunggimna abawl leh kei guoh ang suh lunggim sih a, ka gen uongna hilouin noute na bawn un ahing suhlunggim chiet ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tambang mite adingin, noute atamzawin gawtna na pieh uh ama a dingin ahun giap ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuanahsangin tuin na ngaidam zaw ding ua, na hamuon zoh ding uh ahi, tua ahisihleh tambang mi pen alunggim sengnain aval zou kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin ama na itna uh sudet zel dingin ka hing ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noute kunga lai kang gelna ziehpen sil bangkim ah thu na mangna uoi chi kang etchien ut zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sil khat poupou a mi khat pou na ngaidam u’leh, Ken zong ka ngaidam hi, sil khatpou ngaidamna ding poimawna a um pouma leh ka ngaidam mi khu, noute ziehin Khrist ah ka ngaidamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi ahisihleh Setan in eite ah hun lemtang amukha ding hi, aziehpen Setan sil geel dante itheimaw uh ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaban ah Khrist khantanhoi gen dinga Troas khuo a ka hing haw lai in, Mangpa’n kei ding in kot khat ahing honpieh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh ka unaupa Tita tua mun a ka mu lou ziehin ka ha amuong thei sih hi, tuachi’n amaute mangpha ka hah a, Masidonia gam zuon in ka peita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh Khrist a guolzawna hing pe zelpa leh koute zang a mun chin a Ama theina gimnamtui theisahpa Pasian kungah kipah thu umta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen hundam a umte leh mangthaite lah ah Pasian a dingin Khrist gimnamtui ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawlkhatte a dingin shina dinga shina gimnam ka hi ua, pawldang khat a dingin hinna dinga hinna gimnam ka hi uhi. Tualeh tam silte dinga chingzou ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen mitampiten Pasian thu summet bawlna a azah bangun, kouten ka zang sih uhi. Hinanleh Pasian a kipata sawlte bangin gin umtah in Khrist ah Pasian thu ka gen zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kouma leh kouma kigenpha pankia ka hita uoi mah? Ahisihleh, kouten midangte banga na kung ua ahisihleh noute akipat genphatna lai poimaw ka hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute ka laihah uh, ka lungtang ua kigiel, mi zousie thei leh sim na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute pen Khrist laihah koute sepga na hi uh chi na kilangsahta uhi, laitui a kigiel hilou, Pasian hing Hagau hing gel, Suongpeh tunga kigiel hilou, tahsa lungtang peh tunga kigiel na hi zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kouten tambang muonna Khrist zal in Pasian lam ah ka nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangpou kouma akipat a ahi chi ding in kouma bou kachin uh ka chi sih ua, kachin na u’khu pasien kunga kipat ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aman thuhun tha nasem thei dingin koute ahing chingsah a, dan kigiel sate nasem hilou in Hagau nasemte ka hizaw uhi, aziehpen dan kigiel in athat a, Hagau in hinna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh suhbei a um ding thupina a suhthupi a aum zieh a, Israel taten Mosi maitang entang ngamlou khop a, shina nasepna suongpeh a, akhuoh a kigiel bawn athupi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hagau nasepna khu bangchi’n athupi zaw lou thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Siemmaw tansahna nasep bawn tambanga thupi ahileh, dihtatna nasepna khu nahpitah in athupi zaw sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam thu ah, thupina um masa khu thupina thupizaw in akhupkhel ziehin, athupi nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suhmanga um thupina bawn tambanga thupi ahileh a umden pen khu nasatah in a thupi zaw sem ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin tambang kinepna ka neiziehun thugen ka hangsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amuol a mang hiei hiei atawpdonga Israel taten tangtah a et theilouna ding ua amai puona khukhum Mosi bang ka hi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh alungsim uh khausah in a um a, tuni dongin thuhun lui asim chiengun, tua maikhuna khu hawhkhiet lou in a umden a, tua maikhuna khu Khrist ah hawhkhietin aumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh tuni dongin Mosi laibu asim chiengun alungtang uah maikhuna khu a umden nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahivang in Mi koi zong Mangpa lam a akihei chiengun tua maikhuna khu lahmangin aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mangpa khu Hagau ahi a, Mangpa Hagau umna phot ah noplenna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh eite pen i unpi un, maikhu lou in himlang a ki en bangin, Mangpa thupina khu en zingin, tua toh kibanga um dingin Mangpa Hagau in thupina apat thupina ah ahing sulamdang zing hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin Pasian khotuona ka mu bang ua tami nasepna ka tanziehun, ka lungke sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh sil zumhuoi kiphuolte ka tawpsanta ua, lepchie na lungsim leh zebawl na zang ka hi sih ua, tualeh zebawlna thu toh Pasian thu ka heikawi sih uhi, Thutah kichientahin ka gen zaw ua, Pasian mitmu ah michin sie leh pha theina mit ka tungsah zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka khantanhoi uh khukhum a aum leh zong mangthaite kungah khukhum in aum ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tulai leitung pasien in agingtalou mite lungsim amielsah ta hi, Tuachilou in Pasian limleh mel kibatpi Khrist khantanhoi thupina in amaute asalvah kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen kouma leh kouma kigen ka hisih ua, Jesu Khrist khu Mangpa ahi, chi leh koute pen Jesu Khrist ziehin na suohte uh ka hi zaw uh chi ka gen zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen Jesu Khrist mel a Pasian thupina theina vah hing pe dingin, “Miel lah a kipata vah hing vahdoh dinga” thupepa Pasian in ka lungtang uh asalvah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh silbawltheina thupina khu koute akipat hilou a, Pasian apat ahizawh theina dingin, tua gou khu leibelte ah ka kem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ningchin ah suhgenthei in ka um ua, hinanleh suhguoi in ka um sih uhi, lungdong in ka um ua, hinanleh kinepna bei in ka um sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawlgenthei in ka um ua, hinanleh Pasian taisan in ka um sih uh, Satpua in ka um ua, hinanleh suhmang in ka um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kouten ka tahsa pumpi uah Mangpa Jesu shina ka paw zing ua, ka tahsa pumpi ua Jesu hinna akilatna dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Jesu hinna zong ashi thei ka tahsa ua, sulat a aum theina dingin, kou ahing nalaite pen bangchih laipou in Jesu zieh a shi dinga piehkhiet in ka um zing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n koute ah shina in nna asem a, hinanleh noute ah hinna in asem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka gingta a tuaziehin ka genta hi, chia kigiel bangin, tua hinna hagau mama khu nei in, “Kouten zong ka gingta ua, tuaziehin ka gen uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Mangpa Jesu kaithou pa in koute zong Jesu toh ahing kaithou dinga noute toh Ama umna ah ahing puikhawm ding chi ka thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thupina dinga, mi tampite kipahthugenna zal a, hepina apun semsem na dinga sil zousie noute zieh a um ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin ka lungke sih uhi, ka pulam mihinna uh zawngkhal semsem nanleh, ka sunglam mihinna uh pen nisim a siemtha in aum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen mitphietkal sung ka gimthuohna uh jang noukhat in kumtawn thupina gih zaw ahing bawlpieh zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sil mu theite enlou in, sil mu theiloute ka en zaw uhi. Aziehpen sil mu theite pen tomnou khat sunga ding ahi a, silmu theiloute pen kumtawn a ding ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aziehpen tam puonbuh itenna ileitung inn uh suhsiet in um nanleh khuta lamlou Pasian akipat kumtawn inndet van ah inei uh chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Van a kipat a i tenna dinguh silthuopsah a um ding lunggul in, tam mun ah thum in i um tadi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabanga silthuopsah a ium chiengin saguoh in i um sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen ei tam puonbuh a umte pen puohgih pua in thum a mauin i um tadi uhi, sillou a i um ut zieh uh ahi sih a, hinna leh shithei khu hinna valzou a aum theina dingin, silthuop sah a ium ut zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami ding mama a eite hing siem Pasian ahia khelna manbat ditna Hagau zong ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin kimuongtahin i um ngitnget uhi, tami tahsa inn a i um laisie uh, Mangpa toh i umkhawm sih uh chi ithei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aziehpen ginna in ipei ua, mu thei in ipei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kimuongtahin i um uh kachi ahi, tahsa a umlou in Mangpa toh ium ut zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuaziehin um in um sih nan lei zong, Ama kipahpi lam ihi theina dingun isemgim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen michin tahsa a aum sunga asilbawlte asie apha abawl dungzui a asepman anga theina dinga Khrist vaihawmna toupha mai ah ding teitei ding ihi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuaziehin Kouten Mangpa ginhuoidan theiin mite ka zawl uhi; hinanleh ka hina uh Pasian kungah theichien in aum a, noute sie leh pha theina a theichien a ka um uh zong ka kinem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Noute mai a kouma leh kouma kigenpha kia ut ka hi sih ua, lungtang sunglam hilou a, apulam a kisuongte na dawn theina dinguh bang ahiei na nei theina dingun, koute taanga na kisuon theina ding uh hing bawlpieh in ka gen zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aziehpen Koute ka mot u’leh Pasian a ding ahia, ka pil u’leh noute a ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khrist itna in koute ahing sawl teitei hi, aziehpen tambangin ka ngaituo uhi, mi zousie shi taang a mi khat ahing shina ah mi zousie shi ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama mi zousie taanga ashina ziehpen, ahingte zong amau a dinga hing nawn lou a, ashi taang ua shi a thoukiapa adinga ahin zohna dingun, Ama mi zousie a dingin ashi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin tukalsie, tahsa lam ah koima ka thei nawn sih uhi, ahi, tahsa danin Khrist na theita nan u’leng zong, tuin vang ka thei nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuazieh in mi koizong Khrist a a um leh, sil siemtha ahita hi, sil luite abeita a, ngai un ahing thata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh sil zousie Pasian a kipat ahi a, Aman Jesu Khrist ah Ama toh kilem in ahing bawl a, ka kung uah kilemna nasep ahing peta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuachi’n Pasian khu Khrist a um in, leitung mite Ama toh akilemsah ta a, atatkhelnate uh tatkhelna a simpieh lou in, Aman tam kilepkiana thu koute ahing kem sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaziehin koute pen Khrist palaite ka hi ua, Pasian in koute zanga noute ahing nget bangin, Pasian toh kilem un chi’n Khrist taang in ka hing ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama a Pasian dihtatna i hing hi theina dingun, khelna mawngmawng thei ngailou, Ama khu Pasian in eite ziehin khiel in abawl ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Koute Ama toh semkhawmte ka hi ziehun, Pasian hepina phattuompilou a na tanlouna dingun ka hing ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman, “Hun kipah huoi ah ka hing ngaikhie a, Hundamna ni ah ka hing panpi hi,” achi hi. Ngai un, tu hun kipah huoi ahia, Ngai un, tu hundamna ni ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nasep uh gensiet a aum louna dingin, koima puana ding sil bangma ka bawl sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian nasemte bangin sil zousie ah pahtat huoi in ka langsah zaw uhi, thuohhatna nasatahte, bawlsietnate, tahsapnate, lunggimnate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vuohnate, suongkul a khumnate, buoinate, sepgimnate, imutmawnate, ann ngawlnate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sienthouna ah, theina ah, thuohgimna ah, hepisiemna ah, Hagau Siengthou ah leh itna ginumna ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thutah thu ah, Pasian sil bawltheina ah, ziet leh vei ah, dihtatna galvan ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zatatna leh zatatlouna ah, gensietna leh patatna ah, atah hinapi a, solhatmi banga ngohna ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thei mama hinapi theiphahlou banga bawlna ah, Ngai un, shi ding banga vuohthuoh hinapi tha a umlou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lunggim napi lungnop ngitngetna ah, zawng napi mitampi hausatsahna ah, bangma neilou hinapi bangkim neina ah, tamte zousie ah Pasian nasemte ka hi na uh pahtat huoi in ka langsahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw nou Korinth mite, kouten na kung uah kichientahin thu ka genta ua, ka lungtang uh ka hong lien uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kouten noute ka hing kham sih ua, hinanleh nouma deina lam ah na kikham zaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tate kunga thu gen bangin na kung uah ka gen ahi, kang pieh bangbang uh hing pe thuh dingin kihong lien un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ginglou mite toh kituohloupi in hahkol pokhawm sih un, aziehpen dihtatna leh danbeia gamtatna in bang kigopna anei uoi? tualeh vah leh miel in bang kipawlkhawmna anei uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khrist leh Belial in bang kilemna anei uoi? Ahisihleh gingmi leh ginglou miin bang tankhawm anei uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasian biehinn leh milimten kithukimna anei uh amah? Noute Pasian hing bieh inn na hi uhi, Pasian in, “Ama uah ka teng dinga, amaute lah ah ka vah ding, a Pasian uh ka hi dinga, ama u’zong Ka mite ahi dinguh, achi bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaziehin, alah ua kipat in hing pawtdoh unlen, atuom in um un, Mangpa’n achi hi. Asienglou mawngmawng khoi sih un, tuachi’n noute ka hing pom ding a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />noute a dingin na Pa uh ka hi dinga, noute zong ka tapa leh ka tanute na hi ding uhi. Mangpa bangkim bawlthei in” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuaziehin it tahte aw, eiten tambang thuchiemte inei zieh un, Pasian giinna a, sienthouna bukim in, tahsa leh Hagau a buanate apat ikisusiengthou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Koute kungah na lungsim uh hongun, koima tungah adihlou ka bawl sih uhi, koima ka suse sih ua, koima ka zuoubawl sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Noute siemmaw hing tansahna dinga tam thu ka gen ahi sih hi, tumasang lam in zong, i hin leh hingkhawm ding i shi leh shi khawm dingin noute ka lungsim uah na um uhi, chi ka gen zouta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noute kunga thugen ka hansandan athupi a, noute taanga ka kisahtheidan a thupi hi, lungmuonnain ka dimta hi, ka genthei thuohna zousie uah nasatahin ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi, Masidonia gam ka hing tun un, ka tahsa un khawldamna anei sih a, lelam lelam ah suhbuoi in ka um uhi, apulam ah kihauna auma, asunglam ah zauna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahivang in alungkete hamuonpa Pasian in Tita hing tunna tungtawn in ahing hamuonta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh ama hing tunna zieh guoh hilouin, aman noute a hamuonna anei dan leh nouten kei na hing lunggul dan uh, na hing hasietpi dan u’leh kei dinga na phattuomngai dan uh, ahing hil tahin ka lungnopna alien sem semta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka laihah a noute hing lunggim sah kahi khahtah leh zong, ka kisia sih hi, na kisia kha ka hi tah leh zong, aziehpen tua laihahin tomnoukhat sung hinanleh noute ahing lunggim sah chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin vang ka kipah ahi, suh lunggim a na um zieh uh hilouin, na lunggim na un kisia a lungheina ang tut zieh ahi zaw hi, aziehpen Pasian deilam a lunggim na hi ua, Koute zieh in bangma supna na nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian deilam a lunggim na in kisia a hundam na atun hi, tua pen akisia huoi vawt sih hi, hinanleh leitung dan a lunggim na in shina atun zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian deilam a lunggim na in noute sungah bangchituh a noute pilvan na hing tun atai mah, ahi noute kisuhsiengnate, lungthahnate, zaunate, lunggul nate, phatuomngainate, phubalah nate, tam silte zousie ah na sieng uh china mu chiensahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaziehin noute kungah laihah gel nanleng, adihlou bawlpa zieh a ka gel ahi sih a, dihloutah a thuohpa zieh a ka gel zong ahi tuom sih a, koute dinga na kipiehzou dan uh Pasian mitmu a, na kung ua suhlat a aum theina dinga ka gel ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin na hamuonna uah, ka hamuongta uhi. Tualeh Tita lungnopna ziehin ka kipah tungtuong uhi, na unpi ua alungsim na tohhal zieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen bang ahiei a, noute ka hing kisahtheipina ama kungah nei nanleng ka zum sih hi, hinanleh thutah a sil zousie na kung ua ka gen bang un, Tita kunga ka hing kisahtheipina zong thu tah ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nouten na unpi ua, na thumandante u’leh zau leh chitun pum a, ama na kipahpi dante uh ageldoh chiengin, alungsungah noute ahing ngaina deu deu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin sil zousie a noute muonngamna ka nei zieh in ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin unaute aw, Pasian in Masidonia gam a hattuomte kungah hepina apie chi ka hing theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachia suhgentheina a ze etna thupitah akipahna uh kichingtah leh azawn mama na u’khu sil phalna lam a hepina hauna thupitah in aluonglet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amauten anei dungzui un apie ua, anei sang ua tamzaw zong ape nuom uhi chi ka theipi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua silpieh khu pompieh ding leh, misiengthoute nasepna a atel theina dingun hatang nget in ahing ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tami koute kinepna banga bawl hilou in Pasian dei bangin, amauh mama Mangpa kung leh koute kungah akipe masa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Tita in ana patsa mabanga noute lah a hepina nasep bukimsah leh chi’n ama ka ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n sil bangkim a, ginna, thugentheina, phatuomngaina zousie leh koute na hing itna ua na hausat bangun, tam hepina a zong na hing hausat theina dingun thanop suo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thupieh bangin ka gen sih a, hinanleh midangte phattuom ngai na in na itna uh a tahtah ahi nai chi etchienna dinga ka gen ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen nouten i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist hepina na thei uhi, agentheina zieh a na hing hausat theina dingun, Ama hausa mama nanleh, noute ziehin ahing gentheita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tam thu ah hoi ka sah dan ka gen ahi, aziehpen tami nou a dingin ahoi ahi, kum khat peita a bawlpan masa noute na hi ua, na bawlpat guoh uh hilouin pieh nopna nei masa pen na hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin tam nasep bukimsah unlen, na utna utoh kikhom leh, na nei utoh kikhom a pieh dinga na lunggul bang un sutangtung un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen utna lungsim aum masah pouleh, mi aneilou dan dung zui a hilouin, anei dan dungzui a pompieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Midangte tung jang sah a, noute puohgih hing guon ka hi sih a, hinanleh kibangguol a um ding ka dei man ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu huntah a na kiningchinna uh, amaute tahsap awnghuhna ahing hia, amaute kiningchinna zong noute tahsapna awnghuhna ahing hi theina ding leh kibahguolna ding ka chi ahi zaw hi, tuachi’n kibahguolna ahing um thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Alakhawm tam in avalin bangma anei sih a, alakhawm tawm in zong bangma atasam tuom sih,” chia na kigiel bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh na tung ua tuabangma a, phatuom ngai na Tita lungtang a koipa Pasian kungah kipahthu um hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen koute hanthawnna akipahpi a, hinanleh ama kithalawpna mawng leh ama tupna mawnga na kung ua, hing haw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Unaupa khat toh ama ka hing sawl uhi, ama pen khantanhoi nasepna a hattuomte zousie patat khat ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua guoh hilou in, Mangpa thupina ding leh ka silhoi deina uh ensah dinga, tam hepina thu a ka nasepna ua koute toh zinkhawm kawi kawi ding a hattuomten ana telsa mawng uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tam silpiehte ka hawmna uah koiman ahing gensiet louna dingun ka pilvang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mangpa mitmu guoh ah hilou in, mihing mitmu ah zong sil kilawm bawl ka ut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tualeh amaute toh i unaupa uh ka sawl ua, ama pen sil tampi ah aphattuomngaidan ka theichienta ua, ta diehin na tung ua tahsanna lientah anei ziehin aphatuom ngai sem sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tita ahileh noute lah a ka seppi leh ka lawm ahi, i unaute uh ahileh, hattuomte thupote leh Khrist thupina ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin amaute kungah leh hattuomte mai ah na itna uh theichienna ding leh noute kang kisuonpi dan uh ensah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin misiengthoute dinga nasepna tungtangthu na kung ua hing gel angai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Noute tuabang nasepna ah na kithalawp uh chi ka thei hi, Akaia gam silpieh pe ding a mansa a aumna kumkhat ahita, chi’n Masidonia gam a mite kungah ka hing kisahtheipita hi; tualeh na thanopna un, mi tamzawte akithalawp sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh tam thu toh kisai a noute ka hing kisahtheipina uh amawhna ahilouna dingin unaute ka hing sawl hi, ka gensa banga mansa a na um theina dingun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachilou in Masidonia gam a mite khat pouin hing zui in noute kimansa louin hing muta u’leh (noute kang chi sih uh) kouten hing tahsanga ka hing kisahtheipina lam uah ka maizum kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin masanglai a na chiemsa uh, silpieh khu lahpieh thaw hilou in, phaltah a pezaw a mansa diema na koina dingun ahun masang in unaute na kung ua hing haw masa dinga hanthawn ngaiin ka ngaituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami ahi ka thugen, athe tawmin a at tawm dinga, athe tam in a at tam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Michin in alungtang ua atup bangin pie heh, phallou sasa a pieh ding ahi sih a, phut thaw banga ngai a pieh ding zong ahisih hi, aziehpen Pasian in kipahtah a pemi a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh Pasian in hepina zousie kichingtah in noute ahing pe thei hi, tuachi’n noute bangchih laipouin, silzousie a buching taha umin, nna hoi chinteng sem dingin ahing kiningchingsah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman gamtuom ah ahawmzah a, “Mi zawngte kungah apie hi. Adihtatna kumtawnin a umden hi.” Chiin akigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama haichi thepa kunga haichi pepa in, na neh dinguh tanghou ahing pie a, na haichi the uh apung sah a, na dihtatna ga uh zong akhangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sil phal dinga bangkima suhhausat a umin, tua khuin koute zieh a Pasian kunga kipah thu genna a um sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen tami nasepna in misiengthoute tahsap awng ahuhpieh guoh ahi sih a hinanleh Pasian kunga kipah thugenna tampi zong aluonglet sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami nasepna a etkhieh a umin, Khrist khantanhoi na gintatna u’leh na zuidan u’leh, ama u’leh midangte adinga silpieh a na kiphal dan un, Pasian athupisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh amauten zong noute tunga um Pasian hepina gensenglou ziehin noute a dinga thungen in ahing ngai mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Silpieh gensengloute ziehin Pasian kungah kipahthu um hen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin Keima Paul in Khrist zaidamna leh nunnemna in noute ka hing ngen ahi: Noute toh ka umkhawm chiengin na lah uah ka kingiemsah a, hinanleh ka umlou chieng in noute adingin ka hangsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hinanleh koute tahsa lam a um hi a hing ngaituo pawl khatte tunga hansan ding ahi chia ka ngaisutnate, na kung ua ka um chienga tuabanga ka hansan louna dingin noute ka hing ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen Koute tahsain um nan u’leng, tahsa dan in ka dou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka galdouna galvante uh, tahsa galvan ahi sih a, kulpi dettah suchim thei Pasian silbawltheina nei galvante ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kinielnate leh Pasian theina dou a kisangkoina chinteng ka paikhie ua, mihing ngaituona chinteng Khrist thumanna suoh a puiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh na thumanna uh suhbukim ahi chienga, thu manglou zousie gawt dinga mansa a um in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nouten sil apulam kilatdan en na hi uoi mah? Mi koipou Khrist a hi a, ama leh ama akitheichien ngam ahileh, tam pen aman ngaituo pha kia heh, ama Khrist a ahi bangin koute zong Khrist a ka hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen noute suhsietna ding hilou a, bawlhoizawhna ding a, Pasian hing pieh ka thuneina uh, Kisahtheipi nan u’leeng zong ka zum sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachilou in ka laihah a noute hing suhzau sawm ka bang kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen amauten “Alaihahte pen agihin ahat hi, hinanleh ama ahing um chiengin atahsa azawngkhal a, athugen zong ahawmthaw huoi hi,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuabang miten tami ngaituo u’heh, na kung ua ka umlou chieng ua laihah thute a ka um bangbang un noute lah a ka um chieng un zong ka um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Koute pen ama leh ama kiphat mite lah ah ka kisimtel ngam sih ua, amaute toh zong ka kitekah ngam sih uhi. Hinanleh amaute pen ama u’leh ama uh tena akizangtuo in, amauleh amauh kitekahin lungsim neilou in aum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangteng hileh Kouten ka tena hun kalval un ka uong sih ding uhi, hinanleh Pasian in ahing guot mawpuohna toh kikhom in ka uong zaw ding uhi. Tua mawpuohna ka tan un noute zong ahing huop kha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Kouten noute hing huomkha lou bangin ka tena kalval un ka kisiel sih uhi. Khrist khantanhoi genin noute kung nangawn ah ka hing pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka tena val uh, chi pen midangte sepsa tunga kisuong ka hi sih ua, na ginna uh akhan bang zel in, ka huopkhahna tan chieng uah, noute ziehin nahpitah a suhlet in ka um ding uh chi ka kinem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na gam kallam uh tandonga khantanhoi gen ding ka hi uh, midangte sepna sunga nna kisemsate ka kisuonpi ut sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanleh akisuong pouma Mangpa ah kisuong heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen ama leh ama kiphat khu pahtat in a um sih a, Mangpa’n apahtatte khu patat a um ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka motna neunou ah nouten hing na, thuohpi u’lachin ka dei hi. Ahi na hing thuohpita tham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian thangsietnain ahi noute a dinga ka thangsiet. Pasal khat a dingin noute ka hing khamta hi, aziehpen Khrist kungah noute nungah siengthou banga ka hing pieh theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh gul in apil lepchiena a Evi asol bangin Khrist a, na gin umna u’leh siengthouna a na kipumpieh na uapat na lungsim uh suhsiet a aum khah ding ka zau mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen mi koi ahiei khat hing pei in ka gen ngailou uh Jesu dang khat hing genta leh, ahisihleh na tansa uh hagau pen hilou hagau dang khat na tan ua, ahisihleh na pom ngailou uh khantanhoi dangkhat na pom ua ahileh kipe bai taluo na hina sih ding uoi mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawltah thupipente sanga neu zawin ka kingaituo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thugen kizil a siem hi sih nanleng, theina lam ah tuabang ka hisih hi. Hinanleh silbangkim ah na lah uah suhlat in ka um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kung ua Pasian khantanhoi amanbei a ka gen a, noute tawisanga na umna ding ua, kei ka kingiemsah khu silbawlkhiel ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Noute nna ka sep theina dingin, ama ua kipat law na lain, hattuom dangte neisa ka lahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na kung ua ka umlai a tahsap ka nei chiengin, noute a dingin puohgih ka hi sih hi. Masidonia gam a pat a hing pei unauten ka tahsap awng ahing huhpieh uhi, silbangkim ah, noute subuoilou dingin ka kikem a, tuabangin ka kikem zel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khrist thutah keima a aum ziehin kisiel nanleng, Akaia gam a mi koiman ka kisielna asutawp sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh in la? Noute kang itlou ziehin maw? Pasian in athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh lemtanna deite apat lemtanna ka sattan theina dingin ka bawl khu ka bawl zel ding hi, akisielna ua koute banga ahing um theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tambang mite pen sawltah dihloute ahi ua, solhat a nasemte, Khrist sawltah a kibawlthute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tam pen alamdang ahisih hi, Setan nangawn zong vah sawltah bangin akibawlthu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin anasem mite, dihtatna nasem mite bangin kibawlthu nan u’leh zong alamdang ahi sih hi, atawpna uh pen anasep bang dungzuiun ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka gen kia nalai ding hi, koiman kei mi moin hing ngaituo sih u’heh; ahisih vanglah leh keima themkhat beeh ka kisiel theina dingin amo bang in hing pom phot un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thugen khu Mangpa thuneina toh ka gen ahi sih a, tam kisahtheina a mi mo bangin ka gen zaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi tampite tahsa dan a akisiel ziehun, kei zong ka kisiel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute na pil mama ziehun, mi mote kipahtahin na thuoh zou zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noute mi khat in suohin hing puiin, hing ne gamta leh mi koi ahiei in nou a kipat in lamang taleh, tualeh mi khat ama leh ama kiliensah in na maitang uh hing behpieh taleh, na thuoh zou zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuabanga bawl dingin koute ka hatmaw seng uhi, chia gen khu ka zumna giap uh ahi. Hinanleh midangte ahansan leh mi mo bangin genta leng, kei zong ka hangsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaute Hebru ahi uh amah? Kei zong ka hi, Amaute Israel mi ahi uh amah? Kei zong ka hi. Amaute Abraham tate ahi uh amah? Kei zong ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaute Khrist nasemte ahi uh amah? Kei zong ka hi sem hi, mi mo thugen bangin genta leng, sepgimna lam ah ka semgimzaw sem a, vuohna lam ah atuong avalin ka thuoh a, suongkul ah ka taang mun zaw a, shi zauhuoina ka tuoh mun zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judate lah a kipat in satna sawmli vei chinna ding khat a sam ngavei ka tuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thumvei chienga zep ka thuoh a, khatvei suonga se in ka um a, thumvei kuong sietna ka tuoh a, nikhat leh zan khat tuipi thuhtah lai ah ka um a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khuolzinna ah tamveipi; tuipi tung shi zauhuoina, ka tuoh a, suomhatte akipat shi zauhuoina ka tuoh a, ka chipi ka nampite lah a kipat shi zauhuoina ka tuoh a, Jentelte lah akipat shi zauhuoina ka tuoh a, khopi sungah shi zauhuoina ka tuoh a, gamdai ah shi zauhuoina ka tuoh a, Tuipi a shina zauhuoi ah, unau tahloute lah a shina zauhuoi ah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Gimtah a sepgimna ah, tampi vei imutlouna ah, gilkiel leh dangtahna ah, tam veipi ann ngawlna ah dapsa leh saguoh in ka um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tambangteng ban ah zong, hattuom chinteng ka awlmawna thuh tahin kei gihtahin nichin in ahing netkhum ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Koi ahiei zawngkhal a um a ken ka zawnkhalpi lou? Koi ahiei khelna a pua a ken ka lunggimpi lou?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kisiellou theilou ka hileh, ka hatlouna lam silte ka kisielpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pasian leh i Mangpa uh Jesu Khrist Pa, kumtawn a pahtawi a umin, ka zuoulou dan athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Damaska a Aretas leengpa nuoi a uhpipain kei hing matsah tum in Damaska khopi galkapten aveng sah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanleh kulpi panga kotta apat bawma khaikhiehin ka um a, akhut apat ka suohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei dingin kisiel phatuom sih nanleh, ka kisiel na lai dinga, Mangpa apat mengmuna leh kilahna ka hing gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khrist a um mi khat ka thei hi. Apeisa kum sawm leh kumli peita hun laiin ama van thumna tanah lahtouin a um hi. Tahsa a lahtou a um ahiei, tahsa akipat pawtkhie a lahtou a um ahiei chi ka theisih, Pasian in athei hi, tuabang mikhat van thumna a lah tou in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang mi khat ka thei hi, tahsa in ahiei, tahsa akipat pawtkhiein ahiei ka thei sih, Pasian in athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama khu Paradise a lahtouin aum a, mihing genkhieh theilou leh genkhieh sienglou thute ava za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tambang mi ka kisielpi dinga, Keima pen ka hatlounate chiloungal ka kisiel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kisiel ding lunggul tentun nanleng mi mo ka hi sih ding, thutah gen ding ka hi ziehin. Hinanleh mi koi ahiei in kei ahing mu leh ka thugen azah bang sanga thupi zaw a ahing koi louna dingin ka kidiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kilahnate atam seng zieha ka kiletsah louna dingin kei hing bawl genthei dingin Setan sawltah ling khat ka tahsa tungah ahing kipie hi, tuachilou in ka kiliensah seng kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam ling kei a pat a ladoh dingin Mangpa kungah thum vei ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanleh Aman ka kungah, “Ka hepina nanga dingin ahun hi, aziehpen kahatna khu hatlouna ah suhbukim in a um hi,” ahing chi hi. Tuaziehin Khrist silbawltheina ka tunga aum theina dingin, kipahtahin ka hatlounate ka kisielpi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin hatlounate ah, zumhuoinate ah, tahsapnate ah, bawlsietnate ah, hasatnate ah, Khrist ziehin ka kipah hi, azieh pen ka hatlou hun chiengin ka hat zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kisahtheina in mi mo ka suohta, nouten alou theilou a na hing suohsah uh ahi, nouten kei na hing pahtawi zoh ding uh ahi, aziehpen bangma hisih nanleng zong sawltah lienpente sangin neunou khat in zong ka ngiem zaw tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atahtahin sawltah hina chiemtenate khu, chiemtenate, sillamdangte, silbawltheina nasepte, noute lah ah kukal tahin akibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noute dinga puohgih ka hilou chilou, hattuom dangte sanga na ngiem zohna uh bang a um ei? Tam dihlouna ah hing ngaidam un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai un, athum veina dinga na kung ua hing haw dingin tuin ka kimanta hi. Noute adingin puohgih ka hi sih ding hi; aziehpen na nei na lam uh dei ka hi sih a, nouma hing dei ka hi. Taten nulepa ading gou akhol ding uh ahi sih a, nu leh paten tate adinga gou akholkhawm ding uh ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh ken noute adingin kipahtahin ka seng dinga, ka ki seng bei ding hi; ken noute kang it semsem chiengin, nouten kei nang itna uh akiem semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh ahi hi hitaleh, noute adingin puohgih ka hi sih hi. Ahivang in (pilkhel na hing chi ua,) pilkhel tah a ka hing matna hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na kung ua ka hing sawl mite lah a koi ahiei zangin noute phattuomna ka hing lahpieh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tita na kung ua hing haw dingin ka na ngen a, tualeh unaupa khat toh ka hing sawl hi. Tita in na phattuomna uh ahing lah pieh kha ama leh? Koute lungsim kibang nasemkhawm ka hi sih uh amah? Kalsuon kibanga pei khawm hilou ka hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Noute kunga kouma leh kouma kingaisiem a hing ngaituo zing na hi uoi mah? Khrist ah Pasian masangah thu ka gen uhi. Hinanleh it tahte aw, sil zousie noute hoina dingin ka bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na kung ua ka hing pei chienga ka dei banga um a, ka hing mulou khah ding leh nouten keina deibang ua na hing mu khahlou ding uh ka zau hi, tuachilouin na lah uah kihaunate, kithangsietnate, lungthahnate, kilangkhennate, kigensietnate, kiguhhounate, uonghamnate, tualeh buoinate aum kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na kung ua ka hing pei kia chiengin, ka Pasian in na lah ua hing zalasah lou in, tu masanga na khielsate, lah a sienthoulouna leh kingaina thanghuoi a patatna uapat kisia a lung heilou nalai mitampite ka kakhum kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami na kung ua kang haw athum veina ding ahita hi. Theipi mi ni leh thum kam ah thu chinteng suhkip ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tumasangin ka hing hilta hi. Na kung ua Kang haw aniveina a, na kung ua ka um lai a ka gen bangin, tuin na kung ua umlou in, tumasanga sil bawlkhielte leh mi dang zousie kungah ka hing gen masah ahi, ka hing hawkia chiengin ka dawm sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nouten Khrist in Keima a thu agen khu theichienna na sui zieh un, Ama noute lam ah ahatlou sih a, na lah uoh silbawlthei tah ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama hatlouna ziehin kilbeh in um nanleh Pasian silbawltheinain ahing ahi. Aziehpen koute zong Ama ah hatlou ka hi ua, hinanleh Pasian silbawltheinain noute lam ah Ama toh ka hingkhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ginna ah na umna uoi mah nouma leh nouma ki enchien unlen, kithei chien un. Nouma ah Jesu Khrist aum chi theilou na hi uoi mah? Tuachilouin na chinglakha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh Koute achinglou ka hi sih uh chi nang thei uh ka gingta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Silgilou na bawllouna dingun tuin Pasian kung ah thu ka ngen hi, tuapen koute achinga ka kilatna ding uh ahi sih a, noute mitmu ah achinglou himaithei nan u’leng nouten apahtat huoi silte na bawltheina dingun thu ka ngen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen thutah douin bangma ka bawl thei sih ua, thutah a ding ngen ka bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koute ka hatlou ua, noute na hat chiengun ka kipah uhi. Tami zong ka thumna uh ahi, tuapen noute pichinsah a na umna dinguh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin suse ding hilou a, bawl hoi zaw dinga Mangpa’n ahing pieh thuneina dungzui a ka hing vau louna dingin na kung ua ka umlou pet in tam silte ka hing giel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Unaute aw, atawpna pen in Mangpha, hing piching unlen, Hamuongtahin um unlen, lungsim munkhat puoin um un, kituohtah in um un, Itna leh lungmuonna Pasian noute toh a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kitawpna siengthouin khatlekhat kinousiet un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Misiengthoute zousie in noute mangpha ang hah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mangpa Jesu Khrist hepina leh Pasian itna leh Hagau Siengthou kipawlpina, noute toh umta hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
